1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,480
it's you i found you you're her aren't you you're my old friend i can't believe it

2
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:22,640
i loved you so much didn't we take a photo together i remember we drank some honey ginger

3
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:28,960
milk that mom made for us and then we sang the love song why didn't you say anything

4
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:33,920
you're warm you must still have a fever

5
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:49,520
that pendant was mom's why do you have it when the only one who could is the bear that killed her

6
00:00:49,520 --> 00:01:02,480
what's going on

7
00:02:33,028 --> 00:02:44,028
I was once unwanted. A lonely bear cub. Abandoned in the human world.

8
00:02:46,028 --> 00:02:47,028
I found you.

9
00:02:52,028 --> 00:02:54,028
That was when I met him.

10
00:02:55,028 --> 00:02:59,028
Don't worry, I'll shelter you. This school is my box.

11
00:02:59,028 --> 00:03:05,028
He really, really liked boxes.

12
00:03:06,028 --> 00:03:11,028
My dear Eureka, it's important for you to understand that this world sullies anything pure.

13
00:03:12,028 --> 00:03:17,028
Here. If I do this, the flower will be able to stay unsullied for the rest of eternity.

14
00:03:18,028 --> 00:03:21,028
You see, in this world, only the unsullied have value.

15
00:03:21,028 --> 00:03:36,028
You're incredibly beautiful, Eureka. And you're so special. The most especially precious treasure I own.

16
00:03:36,028 --> 00:03:50,028
I allowed him to put me into his box. And I was happy there. As long as I stayed inside his box, I was an especially precious unsullied creature.

17
00:03:50,028 --> 00:03:56,028
I was unwanted no more. But then, one day...

18
00:03:59,028 --> 00:04:05,028
I'm afraid I found my next wonderfully unsullied creature. So, I'm leaving.

19
00:04:05,028 --> 00:04:11,028
Wait, wait! Please, my precious one! Please don't abandon me here!

20
00:04:11,028 --> 00:04:15,028
Grrrr-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa-aa!

21
00:04:15,028 --> 00:04:16,028
K'nushak!

22
00:04:16,028 --> 00:04:21,588
In that moment, I learned the truth.

23
00:04:22,428 --> 00:04:24,988
I understood what he was trying to teach me.

24
00:04:25,788 --> 00:04:28,268
You must box up what is precious to you.

25
00:04:28,868 --> 00:04:33,208
Otherwise, they'll walk right out of your life and wind up sullied.

26
00:04:34,088 --> 00:04:37,308
From now on, this school is my box.

27
00:04:41,068 --> 00:04:42,808
Why are you cutting them down?

28
00:04:46,028 --> 00:04:49,448
I have to cut all these blooms before they get sullied.

29
00:04:49,808 --> 00:04:51,388
If not, I can't put them in a box.

30
00:04:53,028 --> 00:04:54,988
Why would you want to box them up?

31
00:04:55,168 --> 00:04:58,148
So I can protect these pure precious things from the world.

32
00:04:58,968 --> 00:05:02,548
If I protect all the things that are precious to me, then I will be special.

33
00:05:03,148 --> 00:05:05,028
Because if I am not special...

34
00:05:05,968 --> 00:05:09,808
If I am unwanted, no one will find me.

35
00:05:10,388 --> 00:05:11,508
I found you.

36
00:05:11,508 --> 00:05:15,848
You found me? Are you sure?

37
00:05:16,428 --> 00:05:16,828
Yes.

38
00:05:17,248 --> 00:05:19,068
So get out of that box of yours.

39
00:05:19,448 --> 00:05:22,608
If you never open the box and see and touch your precious collection,

40
00:05:23,328 --> 00:05:25,988
then you might as well just not have anything at all.

41
00:05:26,748 --> 00:05:28,008
Might as well not.

42
00:05:28,928 --> 00:05:30,348
Do you feel empty too?

43
00:05:30,888 --> 00:05:32,288
Like the whole world is invisible?

44
00:05:33,128 --> 00:05:34,148
Open up your boxes.

45
00:05:34,708 --> 00:05:37,548
I'd love it if you'd show me what is truly precious to you.

46
00:05:37,548 --> 00:05:56,108
And so, Rhea and I became the best of friends.

47
00:05:56,968 --> 00:06:00,468
She gave color to my blank, invisible world.

48
00:06:00,468 --> 00:06:02,508
Everything changed.

49
00:06:07,128 --> 00:06:11,828
I found all sorts of precious and wonderful things when I was with Rhea.

50
00:06:11,828 --> 00:06:19,068
She allowed herself to be sullied with me, and I was honored.

51
00:06:21,828 --> 00:06:22,428
Rhea.

52
00:06:22,428 --> 00:06:25,628
I want to say...

53
00:06:25,628 --> 00:06:31,088
I need to say...

54
00:06:31,088 --> 00:06:34,508
I love you.

55
00:06:37,508 --> 00:06:38,228
Rhea?

56
00:06:39,028 --> 00:06:40,568
Do you love me too?

57
00:06:40,948 --> 00:06:41,368
Yes.

58
00:06:41,608 --> 00:06:43,008
I love you so much.

59
00:06:43,708 --> 00:06:45,688
And we'll be friends forever, won't we?

60
00:06:46,148 --> 00:06:46,688
Yes.

61
00:06:47,208 --> 00:06:48,288
Forever and ever.

62
00:06:49,848 --> 00:06:50,568
Rhea.

63
00:06:51,188 --> 00:06:51,628
Yes?

64
00:06:52,888 --> 00:06:53,848
Happy birthday.

65
00:06:56,228 --> 00:06:57,108
Yuri Ika.

66
00:06:57,628 --> 00:07:00,388
I thought the perfect gift would be to have proof of our friendship.

67
00:07:00,908 --> 00:07:02,908
A pledge to never forget love.

68
00:07:03,148 --> 00:07:06,688
As long as you don't forget love, you'll never, ever be truly alone.

69
00:07:06,928 --> 00:07:11,188
And if you never give up on love, even if you lose something, you'll never be invisible.

70
00:07:12,108 --> 00:07:12,548
Rhea.

71
00:07:13,368 --> 00:07:14,368
I love you.

72
00:07:15,488 --> 00:07:17,208
Oh, I love you so much.

73
00:07:17,208 --> 00:07:22,268
I knew all along that Rhea's love was different from mine.

74
00:07:22,388 --> 00:07:23,068
I knew it.

75
00:07:23,488 --> 00:07:25,008
But I couldn't help myself.

76
00:07:25,808 --> 00:07:28,708
I wallowed in that sweet, fleeting desire.

77
00:07:29,268 --> 00:07:30,468
And it was beautiful.

78
00:07:36,028 --> 00:07:37,648
Her name is Kureha.

79
00:07:38,088 --> 00:07:39,248
It means red wing.

80
00:07:39,628 --> 00:07:41,048
She's perfect, don't you think?

81
00:07:42,308 --> 00:07:43,548
Let that go.

82
00:07:43,548 --> 00:07:46,888
It seems she went suspended for herself.

83
00:07:47,008 --> 00:07:47,908
Isn't that sweet?

84
00:07:48,548 --> 00:07:49,028
Sweet.

85
00:07:49,328 --> 00:07:53,128
Now, Kureha, say hi to one of Mama's best friends in the whole wide world.

86
00:07:57,408 --> 00:07:57,888
See?

87
00:07:58,428 --> 00:08:00,088
Did I not tell you as much?

88
00:08:00,848 --> 00:08:03,168
You must box up all your precious things.

89
00:08:03,668 --> 00:08:06,348
Otherwise, they'll be sullied and you'll lose them.

90
00:08:06,348 --> 00:08:09,988
Now, Rhea's love has been lost.

91
00:08:10,528 --> 00:08:12,848
That baby took it away and it's your fault.

92
00:08:13,448 --> 00:08:16,528
You left your box like a fool and became sullied.

93
00:08:17,648 --> 00:08:18,728
Babies are perfect.

94
00:08:19,468 --> 00:08:22,148
They're among the purest things in this filthy world.

95
00:08:25,868 --> 00:08:26,928
No more.

96
00:08:26,928 --> 00:08:41,288
I will give up on love.

97
00:08:49,288 --> 00:08:52,188
I'm sullied, so I'm dirty and empty.

98
00:08:53,148 --> 00:08:54,048
I am invisible.

99
00:08:54,788 --> 00:08:58,068
I am not precious enough for someone to box up anymore.

100
00:08:59,588 --> 00:09:02,048
So now, I am a box.

101
00:09:02,988 --> 00:09:07,488
I've become an empty box, wishing for something to fill my void.

102
00:09:10,288 --> 00:09:12,348
The stars rained down.

103
00:09:12,688 --> 00:09:14,008
The world was still invisible.

104
00:09:14,008 --> 00:09:17,228
Then, the wall of severance was formed.

105
00:09:17,548 --> 00:09:19,628
And now, we can never go back again.

106
00:09:21,148 --> 00:09:21,708
Never.

107
00:09:21,708 --> 00:09:22,408
Rhea.

108
00:09:34,408 --> 00:09:35,248
Rhea.

109
00:09:35,948 --> 00:09:36,788
Rhea.

110
00:09:37,528 --> 00:09:38,068
Rhea.

111
00:09:38,768 --> 00:09:40,108
Complete me.

112
00:09:40,628 --> 00:09:42,648
I need you to fill in my gaps.

113
00:09:43,168 --> 00:09:44,348
I'm so lonely.

114
00:09:44,988 --> 00:09:46,028
Please, Rhea.

115
00:09:46,788 --> 00:09:48,748
Please, help me.

116
00:09:49,468 --> 00:09:49,928
Rhea.

117
00:09:49,928 --> 00:09:50,068
Rhea.

118
00:09:51,708 --> 00:09:53,868
Take this pendant with you, sweetie.

119
00:09:54,948 --> 00:09:56,188
It's a love charm.

120
00:09:56,528 --> 00:09:58,368
I know it will help you the way it helped me.

121
00:10:04,168 --> 00:10:04,568
Rhea.

122
00:10:06,128 --> 00:10:08,128
Why did you give your pendant away?

123
00:10:09,008 --> 00:10:10,968
Do you love her instead of me?

124
00:10:11,328 --> 00:10:11,748
No.

125
00:10:12,228 --> 00:10:13,648
She's just Rhea's friend.

126
00:10:13,708 --> 00:10:14,148
Is she?

127
00:10:14,568 --> 00:10:15,388
I don't care.

128
00:10:15,808 --> 00:10:18,368
You threw the proof of our friendship away.

129
00:10:18,668 --> 00:10:19,248
Rhea.

130
00:10:19,248 --> 00:10:21,768
You threw my love away.

131
00:10:21,768 --> 00:10:21,808
You threw my love away.

132
00:10:33,548 --> 00:10:34,428
I ate Rhea.

133
00:10:34,988 --> 00:10:37,788
I wanted to put her in the box of myself.

134
00:10:38,668 --> 00:10:40,308
Surely that would complete me.

135
00:10:41,148 --> 00:10:43,968
At least, that's what I thought.

136
00:10:49,248 --> 00:10:56,128
Even after eating Rhea, I felt starved.

137
00:10:56,928 --> 00:10:59,728
The emptiness inside me still wasn't filled.

138
00:11:00,528 --> 00:11:04,088
Before I knew it, I found myself interrogating her.

139
00:11:04,948 --> 00:11:05,628
Good for you?

140
00:11:06,268 --> 00:11:07,768
Did she have an excuse at all?

141
00:11:07,768 --> 00:11:09,288
Well...

142
00:11:09,288 --> 00:11:17,708
The night my mom was killed by a bear, the pendant she was wearing disappeared.

143
00:11:19,448 --> 00:11:21,548
Why in the world do you have it, Ginko?

144
00:11:22,188 --> 00:11:23,168
Not right now.

145
00:11:23,168 --> 00:11:27,728
The only thing she would say was she couldn't tell me right then.

146
00:11:28,388 --> 00:11:31,648
And when I woke up this morning, both of them had left without saying goodbye.

147
00:11:35,048 --> 00:11:36,048
What are these?

148
00:11:36,588 --> 00:11:40,988
This is the evidence we need to prove they're actually bears disguised as humans.

149
00:11:42,428 --> 00:11:46,908
And as for that Ginko Yurishiro one, she's the bear with Rhea's pendant.

150
00:11:47,768 --> 00:11:49,768
You think she's the bear that killed mom?

151
00:11:50,208 --> 00:11:50,648
Yes.

152
00:11:50,848 --> 00:11:52,068
Of that I have no doubt.

153
00:11:52,488 --> 00:11:52,988
Oh no.

154
00:11:53,648 --> 00:11:54,368
You were young.

155
00:11:54,548 --> 00:11:56,888
She got close to you by saying she was your friend.

156
00:11:57,488 --> 00:11:59,908
Then she took away the most precious thing in your life.

157
00:12:00,388 --> 00:12:01,548
She murdered your mother.

158
00:12:02,468 --> 00:12:05,148
We can't expect love or friendship from them.

159
00:12:05,148 --> 00:12:06,708
They must be excluded.

160
00:12:07,388 --> 00:12:07,988
Excluded?

161
00:12:10,508 --> 00:12:11,488
That's right.

162
00:12:12,048 --> 00:12:13,028
And by the way,

163
00:12:13,928 --> 00:12:16,368
since you stole Rhea's love from me,

164
00:12:16,368 --> 00:12:19,668
that crime will have to be paid for with your flesh.

165
00:12:20,988 --> 00:12:23,608
There's no escaping now, Kurei Asubaki.

166
00:12:24,168 --> 00:12:25,928
You're going to be my bride.

167
00:12:26,428 --> 00:12:27,868
My bride in the box.

168
00:12:27,868 --> 00:12:34,488
Ginko Yurishiro,

169
00:12:34,488 --> 00:12:50,288
I know all about the grave crime you committed.

170
00:12:50,628 --> 00:12:51,688
I know what you did.

171
00:12:51,688 --> 00:12:53,568
You are the one who...

172
00:12:53,568 --> 00:12:58,808
Hey, Ginko.

173
00:12:59,608 --> 00:13:02,168
How about we go back to the other side of the wall?

174
00:13:03,808 --> 00:13:06,668
Lulu doesn't think it matters how true your love is.

175
00:13:07,068 --> 00:13:08,388
When she knows you're a bear,

176
00:13:08,728 --> 00:13:09,288
growl,

177
00:13:09,628 --> 00:13:11,088
Kurei Pai won't forgive you.

178
00:13:12,868 --> 00:13:15,708
Promise kisses only exist in picture books.

179
00:13:15,708 --> 00:13:18,208
Kumariya is the goddess of the wall.

180
00:13:18,688 --> 00:13:20,808
Her job is to separate bears and humans.

181
00:13:21,448 --> 00:13:23,328
She never let us all be friends.

182
00:13:24,828 --> 00:13:26,928
I made you give up on kisses for me, Lulu.

183
00:13:27,528 --> 00:13:29,208
I can't go back to our side now.

184
00:13:29,708 --> 00:13:30,428
Growl, growl.

185
00:13:31,688 --> 00:13:33,468
Even if it means a grave sin?

186
00:13:35,548 --> 00:13:36,648
Growl, growl.

187
00:13:36,768 --> 00:13:38,248
Lulu knows what you did, Ginko,

188
00:13:38,248 --> 00:13:39,028
so please,

189
00:13:39,468 --> 00:13:40,628
let's just go home.

190
00:13:40,628 --> 00:13:42,628
If Kurei Pai finds out the whole truth,

191
00:13:42,728 --> 00:13:43,828
you'll never get love.

192
00:13:44,188 --> 00:13:46,068
But you won't be able to do a promise kiss

193
00:13:46,068 --> 00:13:47,648
without telling her the whole truth.

194
00:13:49,528 --> 00:13:51,168
Come on, let's go home.

195
00:13:51,248 --> 00:13:52,468
Even if you give up on love,

196
00:13:52,588 --> 00:13:53,768
Lulu will still love you.

197
00:13:54,168 --> 00:13:56,128
Lulu doesn't care if she can't ever kiss,

198
00:13:56,388 --> 00:13:57,908
just so long as you're with her.

199
00:13:58,288 --> 00:13:58,508
But,

200
00:13:59,428 --> 00:14:00,248
Lulu, I...

201
00:14:03,088 --> 00:14:05,248
Yes.

202
00:14:05,248 --> 00:14:08,648
Is your love the real thing?

203
00:14:10,068 --> 00:14:10,588
Yes.

204
00:14:12,428 --> 00:14:13,148
Absolutely.

205
00:14:14,528 --> 00:14:17,048
This is a challenge from the wall of Severance.

206
00:14:18,468 --> 00:14:19,428
Kurei Ha, Tsubaki,

207
00:14:19,948 --> 00:14:21,068
if your love is true,

208
00:14:21,608 --> 00:14:22,848
go to the roof immediately.

209
00:14:23,928 --> 00:14:25,608
The bears are waiting for you.

210
00:14:27,228 --> 00:14:28,388
I'm on my way.

211
00:14:28,388 --> 00:14:35,288
We were friends.

212
00:14:36,068 --> 00:14:37,388
Yes, I loved her, but...

213
00:14:39,488 --> 00:14:42,028
I'll never forgive those bears.

214
00:14:42,748 --> 00:14:43,588
I'll ruin them.

215
00:14:44,008 --> 00:14:44,448
Everyone!

216
00:14:46,148 --> 00:14:46,748
Wait!

217
00:14:47,168 --> 00:14:48,188
Please, Ginko!

218
00:14:48,928 --> 00:14:50,188
Lulu really doesn't mind

219
00:14:50,188 --> 00:14:51,708
if you love Kurei Pai, Growl!

220
00:14:51,928 --> 00:14:52,748
Just don't leave her!

221
00:14:52,848 --> 00:14:53,588
Please don't go!

222
00:14:54,008 --> 00:14:54,668
Ginko!

223
00:14:55,468 --> 00:14:56,108
Ginko!

224
00:14:56,108 --> 00:14:56,468
Ginko!

225
00:14:56,468 --> 00:15:00,228
Give yourself over to the humans,

226
00:15:00,548 --> 00:15:02,368
and your love will be approved.

227
00:15:03,488 --> 00:15:05,388
I'm so sorry, Lulu.

228
00:15:06,068 --> 00:15:06,788
Ginko!

229
00:15:09,348 --> 00:15:09,868
Growl!

230
00:15:15,908 --> 00:15:17,068
She's so cool.

231
00:15:18,628 --> 00:15:19,108
However,

232
00:15:19,408 --> 00:15:20,548
I'm not entirely sure

233
00:15:20,548 --> 00:15:21,888
this was the right thing to do.

234
00:15:22,048 --> 00:15:23,008
Don't be so dramatic.

235
00:15:23,348 --> 00:15:24,788
We're only doing what has to be done

236
00:15:24,788 --> 00:15:26,488
in order to find out whose love is true.

237
00:15:27,008 --> 00:15:27,948
Sparkle, Sparkle, Sparkle.

238
00:15:28,348 --> 00:15:30,208
But it still seems horribly cruel.

239
00:15:31,228 --> 00:15:32,588
Order in the court, please.

240
00:15:33,408 --> 00:15:34,368
We swell here

241
00:15:34,368 --> 00:15:36,508
in the space between human and bear.

242
00:15:37,148 --> 00:15:38,388
Everything must be done

243
00:15:38,388 --> 00:15:39,948
according to Kumaria's will,

244
00:15:40,388 --> 00:15:41,448
for that is sexy.

245
00:15:42,528 --> 00:15:43,728
Perhaps it will rain,

246
00:15:44,368 --> 00:15:45,028
Shabagami.

247
00:15:45,028 --> 00:15:53,688
The time has come at last.

248
00:15:54,908 --> 00:15:56,768
Come to me, Kurei Ha-Subaki.

249
00:15:57,448 --> 00:15:58,088
After all,

250
00:15:58,188 --> 00:16:00,528
I cast aside Beardom to become human,

251
00:16:00,988 --> 00:16:02,388
and I did it for you.

252
00:16:02,388 --> 00:16:09,148
Defendant Bear Yiriyika Hakonaka,

253
00:16:09,388 --> 00:16:10,168
I ask you,

254
00:16:10,708 --> 00:16:12,148
will you give up on boxes,

255
00:16:12,568 --> 00:16:14,908
or will you give up on love?

256
00:16:15,608 --> 00:16:17,648
I will never give up on boxes,

257
00:16:18,228 --> 00:16:19,548
so I'll give up on love.

258
00:16:21,548 --> 00:16:23,028
Please, make me human.

259
00:16:23,608 --> 00:16:24,508
I'd like to be there

260
00:16:24,508 --> 00:16:26,508
to see Kurei Ha-Subaki grow up.

261
00:16:27,128 --> 00:16:28,568
Rhea's love is still alive

262
00:16:28,568 --> 00:16:29,488
inside that girl.

263
00:16:30,488 --> 00:16:31,828
And I want to fill up

264
00:16:31,828 --> 00:16:32,888
the box of myself

265
00:16:32,888 --> 00:16:33,728
with that love.

266
00:16:34,288 --> 00:16:36,108
Are you sure you won't regret that?

267
00:16:36,428 --> 00:16:37,908
You realize if you were given

268
00:16:37,908 --> 00:16:38,808
